{
	"Name": "AlertQuery - Okta - Lifecycle - System API - Okta API Token Used From Outside Its Allowed Network Range",
	"Description": "An Okta API token was presented from an address outside the network range it is restricted to. Okta rejected the call, which means either the token holder moved, or the token has leaked and is being used from somewhere else.\n\nEvent type: system.api_token.request_outside_allowed_range\n\nReference(s):\n- https://developer.okta.com/docs/reference/api/event-types/\n- https://help.okta.com/en-us/content/topics/security/api-tokens-network-condition.htm",
